00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:22.300
Carolina or Maryland or whatever, and we just won&nbsp;
a big game, and we're talking and nothing is sad.&nbsp;

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:25.200
&gt;&gt; About your win?
&gt;&gt; Or about the game.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:30.080
My wife did a great thing, poppy. When all of&nbsp;
