&gt;&gt; Well, there are in some people's houses.&nbsp;

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.860
&gt;&gt; Yeah, now because it's just&nbsp;
me and Nicky and our dog, coach.&nbsp;

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:53.040
&gt;&gt; There's a shrine?
&gt;&gt; Well, I'm in a basement&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:59.011
office -- well, the lower level -- and&nbsp;
can I put anything I want in there.

00:04:59.011 --> 00:04:59.023
[8:48:29 AM]

00:04:59.023 --> 00:05:04.120
